      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "With a snap of her whip-blade, Nilah damages any enemies she hits in a straight line in her chosen direction. This action extends her attack range for a short duration.",
      "summary_zh": "随着她鞭刃的一次抽击，尼菈对她所选方向中一条直线上命中的任何敌人们造成伤害。这个行动会在短时间里延伸她的攻击距离。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1529448:4007708"
      ]
    },
    {
