      "summary_en": "Nilah envelops herself in mist, increasing her movement speed and allowing her to gracefully dodge all incoming attacks. Any allies she touches during the mist's duration will also gain this effect.",
      "summary_zh": "尼菈将自身裹入迷雾中，提升她的移动速度并使她能够优雅地躲避所有即将到来的攻击。在迷雾期间，她接触到的任何友方英雄也都会获得这个效果。",
